462:   /**
463:    * Adds a handler that delegates to the given handler if the relative {@code path}
464:    * matches the given {@code path} exactly.
465:    * <p>
466:    * Nesting {@code path} handlers will not work due to the exact matching, use a combination of {@code path}
467:    * and {@code prefix} instead.  See {@link Chain#prefix(String, ratpack.func.Action)} for details.
468:    * <pre>
469:    *   // this will not work
470:    *   path("person/:id") {
471:    *     path("child/:childId") {
472:    *       // a request of /person/2/child/1 will not get passed the first all as it will try
473:    *       // to match "person/2/child/1" with "person/2" which does not match
474:    *     }
