159:    *
160:    * @param classLoader The classloader to use to find the properties file
161:    * @param baseDir The {@link org.ratpackframework.launch.LaunchConfig#getBaseDir()} of the eventual launch config
162:    * @param configFile The configuration properties file
163:    * @param overrideProperties The properties that override default and file properties
164:    * @param defaultProperties The default properties to use when a property is omitted
165:    * @return a launch config
166:    */
