157:  * To use its functionality simply register the module it provides with the {@link BindingsSpec} used to bootstrap the application.
158:  * </p>
159:  * <h3>Groovy Applications</h3>
160:  * <p>
161:  * The Ratpack Groovy add-on provides application modes that automatically incorporate Guice (namely the “Ratpack Script” mode).
162:  * The module registration process is simpler and more convenient in this mode, and there are additional options for obtaining
163:  * Guice bound objects.
164:  * </p>
